\n服の金色は金属のような質感。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Kojl3Ur1gMO4XJV_f7_YendCc7vDTY5q/view?usp=drive_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@guni_shi3/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/56184ede/uploads/origins/2bfded23-b9b0-46d9-859e-67c344f50869?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=12fc6e7a49e0db20d5a727da0a44b366", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1984355, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@guni_shi3/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1984355, "client_id": 3166888, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b8f6e8ca/uploads/origins/348b3781-02dc-4b42-8825-fbd9185ec164?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2777b76aa21053118f9e863230ddd282", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b8f6e8ca/uploads/origins/348b3781-02dc-4b42-8825-fbd9185ec164?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ac7cedb2c8ce77e9bd0f76d179a6f83", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、前回私のOCのイラストを描いていただき、誠にありがとうございました。\nとても気に入っています！今回も私のOC「Nonas」を自由に描いていただきたいと思います。\nダイナミックでかっこいい雰囲気のあるイラストが好みです。服装やアクセサリーなどは自由に選んでいただいて構いません。\nお手数をおかけしますが、どうぞよろしくお願いいたします，ありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1P1Z6gY_0aLET3EPnYRVWl_FmYIpZVzbz?usp=drive_link", "nc": 48, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@guni_shi3/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5661d9da/uploads/origins/ac55b04c-1f1c-4f1f-94a0-23a167f7a2cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=37a785465d25fa96c0e72ddf80fe2673", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1984355, "client_id": 2912360, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@guni_shi3/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1984355, "client_id": 3556166, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/894a8936/uploads/origins/db15093d-d675-4238-a5d2-16f9466067a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=015f0e5614728a1f87791eacafe0a461", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/894a8936/uploads/origins/db15093d-d675-4238-a5d2-16f9466067a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5049708e03bd9c2ac6f540dc5e700333", "src_set": ""}, "body": "先生こんにちは、あなたの絵の色彩はとても美しいので、あなたに手伝って絵を描いてもらいたいです。私は夏の感じが好きで、夏をテーマにしたいと思っています！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1pDwQE_Oyoxx3NG6Z3P6b-6KC7xzCt2dj?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@guni_shi3/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1984355, "client_id": 2164485, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9623b3f1/uploads/origins/f16e3db7-ba4b-4fa3-9be6-d74bc414813a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3e34f1a513b1cd006c351a31901c977", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9623b3f1/uploads/origins/f16e3db7-ba4b-4fa3-9be6-d74bc414813a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5612884823b28956648c6a7d7e68e920", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは\n仕事を終えた鍛冶屋の絵を依頼したい。\n彼は休むつもりだ。\n私が言わなかったことは、あなた次第です。\n\n参照\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DVfY7kQvsotQOdYbL9PKJkSsmzRPRJKW?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@guni_shi3/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1984355, "client_id": 3166888, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce9135de/uploads/origins/7403ffc5-3ab8-4f68-80f1-aad57fdd7dd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e68a51d9fcefb48e94b0f7954e0d630c", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce9135de/uploads/origins/7403ffc5-3ab8-4f68-80f1-aad57fdd7dd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f5a97fcc0f1bbff7c52f19b59fb26ca7", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！\n\n順調だといいね！Skebのオープンを楽しみにしているよ。\n\n私の小さなスネップ・ノナスを自慢できるような、キュートでクールなポーズを期待しています！\n\n何を作るか楽しみにしています！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1P1Z6gY_0aLET3EPnYRVWl_FmYIpZVzbz?usp=drive_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@guni_shi3/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1984355, "client_id": 118710, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/58b9fe78/uploads/origins/ae248dc4-4924-4ae5-8474-d5a3076fa417?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f005e96325a2d4d2440f76a59db5b81e", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/58b9fe78/uploads/origins/ae248dc4-4924-4ae5-8474-d5a3076fa417?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7858d692961bbe94c7dd6d83670b37bb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの画風と色の組み合わせ方に驚きました！\n私のOCをこんな風に描いてもらえますか？こんな感じで：\nhttps://x.com/guni_shi3/status/1901205113437560958\nhttps://x.com/guni_shi3/status/1893673718980678126\nhttps://x.com/guni_shi3/status/1878672786270621942\n\nエレメントの方向は、通り、路地、ぶらぶら、夜、などなど...。\nまた、多くのキャラクターが普通の帽子か後ろ向きの帽子をかぶっていますね。僕のOCもかぶれるといいな！\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/5p8sa3gbt4f80jopdza98/AHT04ZFrpsqmzCyiafFAUtY?rlkey=sckq9valdlfome3sydg0jhuzp&st=sv8trawb&dl=0", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@guni_shi3/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1984355, "client_id": 3402573, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/25983bf4/uploads/origins/489a917c-e1ee-42aa-9afb-2d882b143086?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd204921587f0cc5509ec53a20ebba5a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/25983bf4/uploads/origins/489a917c-e1ee-42aa-9afb-2d882b143086?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5d643a4266bb63528ea6aa6a3529121e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "初めまして！キャラクターイラストの依頼をさせていただきたいです。\n\n茶色のオオカミで、右耳にイヤリングをつけており、キツネのようなふわふわの尻尾が特徴です。服装については参考資料のリンクに添付しておりますので、ご確認ください。ポーズなどの指定は特にございません。\n\nイラストの依頼はあまり慣れていないので、失礼がありましたら申し訳ありません。どうぞよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/102p14_cBrhhadTVJreK0Mu_mERQ7j5uA", "n